{"id":"617937","name":"韭菜豆腐肉末馅饺子","author":"花鱼儿","authorId":"404188","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/617937/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"饺子皮","amount":"1115克"},{"name":"肉末","amount":"360克"},{"name":"老豆腐","amount":"515克"},{"name":"韭菜","amount":"220克"}],"sub":[{"name":"玉米油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"料酒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"酱油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蚝油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材：饺子皮、肉末、老豆腐。","img":"images/617937/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"韭菜（已清洗沥干水分）。","img":"images/617937/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"将老豆腐放入大碗中抓碎。","img":"images/617937/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"将韭菜放在案板上切碎。","img":"images/617937/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加适量的玉米油。","img":"images/617937/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/617937/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"接着，合入抓碎的老豆腐和肉末，加适量的料酒。","img":"images/617937/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加适量的酱油。","img":"images/617937/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加适量的蚝油。","img":"images/617937/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加适量的盐。","img":"images/617937/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"调味拌匀成馅。","img":"images/617937/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"然后，取饺子皮放入拌好的馅。","img":"images/617937/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"包好。","img":"images/617937/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"包好的饺子。","img":"images/617937/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"最后，将包好的饺子下入沸水中煮开煮至浮起，即可。","img":"images/617937/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}